Suggests: lm-sensors, lsof, strace
Description: ghtop - htop fork with NVIDIA GPU and Docker columns
 ghtop is a fork of htop adapted to the rosepetal training and
 inference workstations. It adds:
  * GPU usage bar in the default header layout
  * Temperatures meter (CPU/GPU/PCH/RAM/NVMe/NIC) from /sys/class/hwmon
  * GPUMEM and GMEM% per-process columns backed by NVML
  * DOCKER per-process column that resolves cgroup container ids to
    container names via `docker ps`
 .
 The binary is installed as /usr/bin/ghtop so it can coexist with the
 standard htop package. NVML (libnvidia-ml.so.1) is loaded at runtime
 from whichever NVIDIA driver is installed; the package itself does
 not pin a driver version, and on machines without an NVIDIA driver
 the GPU-related fields just stay at zero.
